---
/**
 * ============================================================================
 * SITE HEADER (Header.astro)
 * ============================================================================
 * What this component does:
 * - Displays the primary headline and introductory subtitle right below the nav.
 *
 * HOW TO MAINTAIN:
 * - Update the <h1> text to change your main title/role.
 * - Update the <p class="headline"> to change your degree/status statement.
 * ============================================================================
 */
---

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container header-layout">
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>Software Engineer & AI Builder, using AI-powered tools to create custom and efficient solutions.</h1>
      <p class="headline">
        Bachelors in Computer Science, with passion for building solutions that make a difference. Currently purusing a Masters in Software Engineering at Arizona State University.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
